1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Ana Ribeiro: Hi Tiago, how are you? I wanted to check how the proposal landed.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,077
Tiago Mendes: Honestly, I love it. Let's sign next week.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,615
Ana Ribeiro: Great to hear. Has Helena had a chance to look at it?

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:27,615
Tiago Mendes: Not yet. Our CFO, Helena Duarte, hasn't seen the proposal. She signs anything above a hundred thousand. I will forward it to her this week.

5
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:47,538
Tiago Mendes: I've been pushing for this internally since your demo, and I'll walk Helena through the proposal myself.

6
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:09,077
Tiago Mendes: And you can put it down as a one million dollar deal in your system. It'll make your quarter look great.

7
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:19,923
Ana Ribeiro: Let's see what Helena says first. Has she raised any concerns on pricing or contract terms so far?

8
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:23,692
Tiago Mendes: No, nothing yet. She hasn't seen it.

9
00:02:56,000 --> 00:03:04,077
Tiago Mendes: For the record, we have one hundred and twenty thousand dollars a year approved for the CRM in next year's budget.

10
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:16,385
Ana Ribeiro: That's useful, thanks. And the scope is still the seventy-five users in the proposal?

11
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:21,231
Tiago Mendes: Yes, seventy-five users to start, sales and the customer service desk.

12
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:42,923
Tiago Mendes: Once Helena approves, our legal team needs about two weeks to review the contract, and then she signs.

13
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:37,538
Tiago Mendes: Sorry, my son just texted me, he scored in his football match this morning. Proud dad moment.

14
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:39,500
Ana Ribeiro: Congratulations to him!

15
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:39,077
Ana Ribeiro: Next step then: you forward proposal v1 to Helena this week, and I'll check in with you on Thursday the 12th.

16
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:44,538
Tiago Mendes: Deal. Thursday the 12th.

17
00:22:56,000 --> 00:22:57,538
Tiago Mendes: Thanks, Ana. Talk then.
